"entity": {
"name": "Phibro Animal Health Corporation",
"description": "Phibro Animal Health Corp. engages in the development, manufacture, and marketing of animal health and mineral nutrition products. It operates through the following segments: Animal Health, Mineral Nutrition, and Performance Products. The Animal Health segment focuses on the development and marketing of medicated feed additives, nutritional specialty products, and vaccines. The Mineral Nutrition segment includes formulations and concentrations of trace minerals such as zinc, manganese, copper, iron, and compounds. The Performance Products segment is involved in the manufacture and marketing of specialty ingredients for use in the personal care, automotive, industrial chemical, and chemical catalyst industries. The company was founded on May 11, 1946 and is headquartered in Teaneck, NJ.",
